flowchart LR
    candidate[Candidate chain] --> classify{Execution and custody model}

    classify -->|Solana-compatible native asset| svm[SVM family kit<br/>RPC · Ed25519 · transaction builder<br/>HTLC program · PDA parser]
    classify -->|TON / TVM| ton[TON adapter<br/>wallet seqno · signed BOC<br/>value transfer · HTLC contract]
    classify -->|ZANO / privacy chain| zano[ZANO adapter<br/>shared keys · watch-only scan<br/>adaptor proof · unilateral refund]

    svm --> identity[Network identity + deployed code<br/>genesis or global ID · signer · fees<br/>program version · finality]
    ton --> identity
    zano --> identity

    identity --> catalog[Append-only pair catalog<br/>native asset · decimals · timing<br/>STAGED until release gate]
    catalog --> protocol[Swap protocol<br/>lock · verify · claim · refund<br/>secret proof · crash recovery]
    protocol --> admission[Offer admission + price/oracle<br/>amount limits · reserve proof<br/>readiness for new swaps]
    admission --> surfaces[Wallet · Rust SDK · Go TUI<br/>dashboard · settings · explorers]
    surfaces --> evidence[Funded two-daemon E2E<br/>both roles · claim · refund<br/>restart · outage · wrong network]
    evidence --> gate{Security and release gate}
    gate -->|Pass| active[Enable new swaps]
    gate -->|Fail| staged[Keep STAGED<br/>repair and rerun]
    staged --> evidence

    identity -. Existing swaps remain recoverable .-> recovery[Claim and refund remain available<br/>even when new offers are paused]
    recovery -.-> protocol

